"Ten healthy adults took {0} g of resistant starch a day, the kind green-ish bananas carry, and after {1} weeks their insulin worked about {2}% more strongly after a meal than on placebo.":"Diez adultos sanos tomaron {0} g de almidón resistente al día, el que tienen los plátanos algo verdes, y tras {1} semanas su insulina funcionaba un {2}% mejor después de comer que con placebo.",
