"Her favourite flowers":"Sus flores favoritas",
"A surprise night out":"Una noche sorpresa fuera",
"Dress up: I’m taking you out this weekend.":"Ponte guapa: este fin de semana te llevo a salir.",
"Dinner out, dancing or an event":"Cenar fuera, bailar o un evento",
"Get the group together":"Reúne al grupo",
"Plan the big night out":"Planea la gran noche",
